  partName: Left Front Sensor (3)
  description: The Left Front Sensor (3) is a tiny, compact component situated at
    the middle-left-front of the engine, monitoring various engine parameters such
    as temperature, pressure, or speed. Made from Material.001, it provides accurate
    and reliable data to the engine control unit. One interesting detail about the
    Left Front Sensor (3) is its ability to detect even minor changes in engine performance,
    enabling prompt adjustments and optimizations.
